      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWEET MILLIE (3) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors six starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (24.45) at Bendigo over 425m. Can find winning form. RAPIDFIRE LAYLA (7) hit the ground running from the squeeze draw with a strong early split last time, paving the way for a 1.5 lengths win at this track over 390m in 22.59. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. JARMON (1) skirted wide from an outside draw last start and found the front, leading throughout to win (24.60) at Bendigo in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 over 425m. Strong form has emerged from her last run. One of main contenders. NIGHT SHARID (5) is another with top-three prospects.",
